# ===================================================================
# KUNLIK YORDAMCHI — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ===================================================================
# QOIDALAR:
# 1. Ushbu fayl namunadir. Haqiqiy maxfiy kalitlarni chatga, loglarga
#    yoki frontend kodiga aslo qo'ymang.
# 2. Production muhitida barcha qiymatlar server Secrets/Environment
#    paneli orqali kiritilishi shart.
# ===================================================================

# NODE_ENV: Ishga tushirish muhiti ("development" | "production" | "test")
# - development: In-Memory repository fallback va demo rejim ruxsat etiladi.
# - production: SESSION_SECRET, TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN va SUPABASE sozlamalari
#   bo'lmasa server qat'iy xatolik bilan to'xtaydi (in-memory fallback taqiqlangan).
NODE_ENV="development"

# PORT: Server porti (AI Studio va Cloud Run muhitida standart: 3000)
PORT=3000

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Gemini 3.8 Flash AI tahlili uchun kalit.
# AI Studio Secrets paneli orqali avtomatik ulanadi.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# APP_URL: Ilova host qilingan URL manzili.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"

# ===================================================================
# TELEGRAM BOT & AUTHENTICATION (PRODUCTIONDA TALAB QILINADI)
# ===================================================================

# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN: Telegram @BotFather orqali olingan bot tokeni.
# Serverda Telegram WebApp initData HMAC-SHA256 imzosini tekshirish uchun zarur.
# Diqqat: Bu token faqat backendda saqlanadi, mijozga (frontend) aslo yuborilmaydi!
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=""

# SESSION_SECRET: Sessiya cookie va tokenlarini HMAC-SHA256 bilan imzolash uchun kalit.
# Talab: Kamida 32 ta belgidan iborat yuqori entropiyali kriptografik tasodifiy satr.
# Productionda koddagi default dev kalitlar qat'iyan rad etiladi.
#
# Tasodifiy kalit yaratish buyruqlari:
#   Linux/macOS: openssl rand -hex 32
#   Node.js:     node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
SESSION_SECRET=""

# ALLOW_DEMO_AUTH: Telegramdan tashqaridagi brauzer preview uchun demo rejimi ("true" | "false").
# - development: "true" bo'lsa test foydalanuvchisi bilan ishlashga ruxsat beradi.
# - production: KOD DARAJASIDA QAT'IY BLOKLANGAN (qiymat true bo'lsa ham 403 qaytaradi).
ALLOW_DEMO_AUTH="true"

# ===================================================================
# SUPABASE / POSTGRESQL (PRODUCTIONDA TALAB QILINADI)
# ===================================================================
#
# BAZA MIGRATSIYASI TARTIBI (Yangi bo'sh bazada):
# 1. Avval "supabase/migrations/20261101_init_user_snapshots.sql" bajariladi
#    (jadval, indekslar, RLS va triggerlarni yaratish uchun).
# 2. Keyin "supabase/migrations/20261102_secure_save_user_snapshot.sql" bajariladi
#    (save_user_snapshot funksiyasi xavfsizligini kuchaytirish va service_role huquqini berish uchun).
# (Faqat 2-faylni bajarish bo'sh bazada jadval bo'lmagani sababli yetarli emas!)
#
# ESLATMA: Supabase SDK client ob'ektini xotirada yaratish (new SupabaseUserStateRepository)
# bu hali real PostgreSQL bilan jonli tarmoq ulanishi tekshirildi degani emas.
# Haqiqiy tarmoq ulanishi faqat to'g'ri kalitlar bilan server so'rov yuborganida sodir bo'ladi.
# ===================================================================

# SUPABASE_URL: Supabase loyihangiz URL manzili.
# Masalan: "https://xyzcompany.supabase.co"
SUPABASE_URL=""

# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY: Supabase service_role maxfiy kaliti.
# Bu kalit RLS qoidalarini chetlab o'tib, backend orqali foydalanuvchi ma'lumotlarini
# xavfsiz boshqarish imkonini beradi.
# DIQQAT: Faqat service_role ishlatiladi va faqat serverda saqlanadi. Anon kalit emas!
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""

